-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived work
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The kinetic models (Patlak with reference region, SRTM) in src/kinetics are a
TypeScript port of a MATLAB package of the MMNI research group at the
University of Cologne, of which the author of this app is an alumnus
(https://github.com/ghaefner/kinetic-modeling), used with permission.

